The SIAN matrix defines, for each SIAN category, which attributes/data must be managed or checked during operations involving SIAN (the dematerialized portal of the electronic wine register).
This table serves as the configuration panel for the first-level control matrix: one row for each SIAN category, while the columns indicate which information is relevant (N.B. not mandatory) for that category.

The control matrix is distributed by MIPAAF.


